(5) Rules and regulations pertaining to public swimming pools, spas, and recreational water parks (adopted by the county board of health and being Ben Hill County Board of Health Rule VI as subsequently amended and updated), and policies of the county board of health pertaining to public swimming pools, spas, and recreational water parks;
